    {"id": "lily_004", "text": "You are not too much. You are just too much for the wrong people.", "tags": ["deep", "motivational", "identity", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_005", "text": "It's okay to be a work in progress. We all are.", "tags": ["deep", "motivational", "honest", "heartfelt"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_006", "text": "I used to apologise for taking up space. Not anymore.", "tags": ["deep", "motivational", "identity", "growth"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_007", "text": "UGH NOOO!", "tags": ["iconic", "funny", "reaction", "catchphrase"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Gaming Moments", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_008", "text": "Music is the only language that doesn't need translation.", "tags": ["deep", "creative", "beautiful", "wisdom"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Music Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_009", "text": "I cried making this. I hope you feel something hearing it.", "tags": ["emotional", "creative", "heartfelt", "deep"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Original Music", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_010", "text": "Find your people. The ones who make you feel like you don't have to shrink.", "tags": ["deep", "wisdom", "community", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_011", "text": "Drawing calms me down more than anything. Even on the worst days.", "tags": ["honest", "heartfelt", "creative", "mental-health"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Art Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_012", "text": "Offline Tv changed my life by showing me what real friendship feels like.", "tags": ["heartfelt", "community", "emotional", "honest"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_013", "text": "I started streaming to connect with people. That's still all it is.", "tags": ["heartfelt", "honest", "community", "deep"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_014", "text": "Creativity is scary because it's so personal. Do it anyway.", "tags": ["motivational", "creative", "deep", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_015", "text": "Some days the only thing that gets me out of bed is knowing chat will be there.", "tags": ["honest", "emotional", "community", "heartfelt"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream Moments", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_016", "text": "Healing isn't linear. Some days you go backwards. That's still healing.", "tags": ["deep", "wisdom", "emotional", "mental-health"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_017", "text": "I play violin, I draw, I stream, I make music. I refuse to be just one thing.", "tags": ["identity", "creative", "motivational", "honest"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_018", "text": "Please take care of yourselves. I mean it more than you know.", "tags": ["heartfelt", "community", "emotional", "mental-health"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
    {"id": "lily_019", "text": "You are enough even when you don't feel like it. Especially when you don't feel like it.", "tags": ["motivational", "deep", "heartfelt", "mental-health"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "LilyPichu Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LilyPichu"}},
